# 📝 Save the Cat Beat Sheet
## Title: *Awakened: Two Worlds, One Truth*
**Genre:** Faith-Based Sci-Fi Allegory  
**Tone:** Dystopian, surreal, spiritually symbolic  
**Theme:** Truth is buried beneath illusion; reality must be spiritually discerned  

---

## 🎬 BEAT 1 – OPENING IMAGE  
**Purpose:** Show the false peace, control, and spiritual deception of the world. Introduce Malak and the system he unknowingly serves.

**Location:** New York City – Sector 3

**Scene:**  
- Cold dawn light over a controlled, muted city.
- Malak walks with uniformed citizens, wearing earbuds and an ID badge: *Signal Restoration – Level 2*.
- A holo-billboard displays a twisted scripture: “God helps those who help themselves — Book of Enlightenment 3:16.”
- The crowd chants it. Malak joins in... but a glitch reveals a real verse: *“Blessed are the poor in spirit...”*
- He makes eye contact with an old man hiding a Bible.  
- A signal light turns green. The moment is gone. But something in Malak shifts.

---

## 🧭 WORLD STRUCTURE

**New York City – The Mind of the System:**  
- Propaganda, signal calibration, scripture rewriting.

**Los Angeles – The Heart of the System:**  
- Holo-churches, Lightkeeper worship, spiritual seduction.

Malak travels between the cities for work — unknowingly maintaining both mental and emotional aspects of the illusion.

---

## 🎭 CHARACTER OVERVIEW

**Name:** Malak (23)  
**Role:** Signal Technician (Level 2)  
**Conflict:** Spiritually asleep but instinctively searching  
**Arc:** From complicit servant of the system to spiritual messenger and truth-bringer  
**Belief at Start:** “This is the world. There is no other.”  
**Belief at End:** “God’s Word is the only truth — and we were born to wake others.”

---

## 📌 COMING NEXT: BEAT 2 – THEME STATED  
