## 🎬 **TREATMENT – *Awakened: Two Worlds, One Truth***

---

**Title:** *Awakened: Two Worlds, One Truth*  
**Genre:** Faith-Based Sci-Fi Allegory  
**Tone:** Dystopian, surreal, prophetic  
**Length:** 30-minute feature short  
**Logline:**  
*In a dystopian future where scripture is rewritten and truth is hidden beneath illusion, a spiritually restless technician begins to question his reality after witnessing a forbidden glitch in the system — leading him on a dangerous path between two cities, two systems, and one buried truth that could set the world free.*

**Premise:**  
*When a spiritually starved technician glimpses a forbidden truth beneath the illusion of a controlled world, his journey to expose it proves that awakening begins when even one soul dares to choose truth over comfort — and in a world built on lies, one act of faith can spark a spiritual uprising.*

---

### ACT I – THE WORLD OF ILLUSION

**EXT. NEW YORK CITY – SECTOR 3 – DAWN**

In a sterile and synchronized version of New York City, technology dominates every layer of life. Malak, 23, is a low-level **Signal Restoration Technician**, responsible for maintaining the flow of approved content — scripture, doctrine, and public programming — all rewritten by a system known as the **Doctrine Authority**.

Citizens wear neural devices called **FaithSyncs**, filtering out “unverified” spiritual content. Holograms of AI-generated preachers quote verses from the "Book of Enlightenment" — a false scripture posing as divine truth. The words “God helps those who help themselves” flash across towering holo-billboards as the crowd chants in unison.

Malak blends in — eyes down, soul numb — until one morning, a **visual glitch** disrupts a billboard. For just a moment, the real verse breaks through:  
> “*Blessed are the poor in spirit...*” *(Matthew 5:3, KJV)*

Only Malak seems to notice. A nearby **Old Man** clutches what looks like a **forbidden Bible** beneath his coat. Their eyes meet. A seed is planted.

---

### ACT II – THE AWAKENING

Malak follows his unease and secretly meets the Old Man, who introduces him to an underground remnant called **The Holders of the Word**. They preserve pieces of the original King James Bible and archived video teachings — specifically from **The Israel of God** — hidden on physical drives buried deep beneath system scanners.

He receives a **single torn page** from the real Word and is tasked with delivering it to **Los Angeles – Sector 7**, the emotional capital of the world — where deception hides in light and the heart is the battlefield.

Malak travels west. As he steps into **L.A.**, he’s greeted by beauty, color, warmth — and deep spiritual seduction. Holo-preachers float above mega-churches, AI influencers cry "love wins" while selling salvation tokens, and “Lightkeepers” preach emotionalism over repentance. The air is full of peace... but it’s hollow.

Malak begins **hearing whispers of the real Word** inside his spirit. He plays a hidden clip from a suppressed teaching — raw, scriptural, convicting — and it cuts through the noise. A new glitch occurs in his vision, shaking his faithsync device loose. The illusion starts to crack.

---

### MIDPOINT – CHOICE OR COMFORT

Alone in a luxury capsule room, Malak faces a spiritual test. He is offered promotion by the system — a higher position in “Religious Outreach” — if he agrees to destroy the page he carries. He hesitates.

Instead, he reads the verse aloud.

The system reacts instantly. **Drone sentries activate**, alarms echo “TOXIC SCRIPTURE DETECTED.” His voice has triggered a war in the network.

---

### ACT III – EXPOSED AND PURIFIED

The Holders of the Word in Los Angeles are captured. The Old Man is declared a “Faith Hacker.” The Lightkeepers broadcast a global warning:  
> “Beware the spirit of rebellion. Return to the truth of unity.”

Malak runs. Alone. Hunted.

He stumbles into the ruins of a burned-down church. Beneath the altar, he finds a **signal transmitter** — once used to broadcast unfiltered truth before it was outlawed. He fixes the hardware using his technician training. He loads the KJV verse. He hesitates.

Then he speaks.

---

### CLIMAX – THE BROADCAST

The signal hijacks New York. Then L.A. Then everywhere. For 3 minutes, unaltered scripture floods the skies:

> “*Blessed are they which do hunger and thirst after righteousness: for they shall be filled.*”  
> *(Matthew 5:6, KJV)*

People pause. Devices shatter. Holo-sermons glitch. Some scream. Some fall to their knees. The **Word pierces through the lie**.

The FaithSync network collapses.

---

### RESOLUTION – THE UPRISING BEGINS

Malak disappears. No one knows where he went.  
But in both cities, people gather in silence, clutching fragments of real scripture. Children whisper verses.

And far beneath the city’s broken skyline, a new verse begins to load in the ruins:

> “*And ye shall know the truth, and the truth shall make you free.*”  
> *(John 8:32, KJV)*

**FADE OUT.**

---

