### **🔹 Logline**  
In a dystopian future where scripture is rewritten and truth is hidden beneath illusion, a spiritually restless technician begins to question his reality after witnessing a forbidden glitch in the system — leading him on a dangerous path between two cities, two systems, and one buried truth that could set the world free.

---

### **🔹 Conflict**  
Malak lives in a society built on lies and false doctrine, where scripture is manipulated by artificial intelligence and controlled by government systems. When he discovers a fragment of the true Word of God, he must decide whether to risk everything to share it — or remain complicit in the deception.

---

### **🔹 Story Spine**  
**Beginning:** Malak lives a numb, controlled life in dystopian New York, working as a technician who maintains faith-based digital signals.  
**Middle:** After seeing a forbidden scripture, he meets a secret believer who sends him on a mission to deliver a real page of the Bible to Los Angeles.  
**End:** Malak risks his life to broadcast real scripture to the world, igniting a spiritual awakening even as he vanishes from the system.

---

### **🔹 Premise**  
When a spiritually starved technician glimpses a hidden truth in a world ruled by deception, his journey to expose it proves that awakening begins the moment one soul chooses truth over comfort — no matter the cost.

---

### **🔹 Theme**  
**Truth vs. Illusion.**  
Even in a world built on lies, the truth of God’s Word has the power to set people free.

---

### **🔹 Character’s Objective**  
Malak wants to understand what he saw — to know if the glitch was real, and eventually to share that truth with others. His objective evolves into awakening people enslaved by a false system.

---

### **🔹 Character’s Arc**  
Malak begins as a numb, obedient technician—silent, unseen, unsure. Through exposure to truth and real scripture, he awakens to purpose. By the end, he transforms into a selfless vessel for truth, willing to risk everything to break the illusion and free others.

