1–2 pages in length total

3–4 scenes with proper scene headings

Properly formatted — page size, font/font size, spacing between lines, margins, and indentations. Capitalization where needed.

Proper use and format of screenplay elements — scene headings, action, character names, dialogue, and parentheticals (if applicable). Must include dialogue.

Written in the third person, present tense.

Remember to Show! Don’t tell.

